SUMMARY:publish notice of termination by
DESCRIPTION:owner or contractor must publish a notice of termination within
  7 days\; the termination date for s.31 is the date the first notice is pu
 blished [Construction Act s.31(6)\,(7)] May roll forward to 2026-03-09 und
 er the holiday rule - do not rely on it. Falls on a weekend/holiday: last 
 business day to act is 2026-03-06. Administrative reminder\, not legal adv
 ice - verify with counsel.
